Module
  name: game_chestaura
  description: Auras on the floor under reward chests, cursed chests and the Sealed Coffer, a slow sigil under the feet of the Templar line and, in a party, a faint frame showing how far a Templar's aura reaches (O315); the server tells the client which Templars have an aura (extended opcode 118); switch in Options > Graphics
  author: Cinders of Chaos
  sandboxed: true
  scripts: [ chestaura_logic, chestaura ]
  dependencies:
    - game_interface
  autoload: true
  autoload-priority: 1006
  @onLoad: init()
  @onUnload: terminate()
